Models used by Loci and their licences
--------------------------------------

Shipped pipeline:
- SAM 3.1 (facebook/sam3.1) - segmentation, tracking, privacy redaction.
  SAM License (see https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam3.1). Code: github.com/facebookresearch/sam3.
- MapAnything, Apache variant (facebook/map-anything-apache) - camera poses, metric depth.
  Apache License 2.0. Code: github.com/facebookresearch/map-anything.
- Muse Glimmer 30B GGUF (unsloth/Muse-Glimmer-30B-GGUF) - agent, local vision, object naming.
  Apache License 2.0. Served with llama.cpp (MIT).
- faster-whisper (MIT) - offline speech fallback (cloud off) and street audio, which never leaves the machine.

Meta Model API (cloud, optional; everything also runs with LOCI_CLOUD=0):
- Muse Spark 1.3 (muse-spark-1.3, Standard mode) - answers questions when cloud is on, with Glimmer on device
  as the fallback. Receives questions, memory tool results and redacted crops only.
- Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0 (muse-voice-transcribe-1.0) - speech in home captures and spoken questions.
Used under the Meta Model API terms (https://dev.meta.ai/docs/overview).
